{"book":"malachi","num":1,"verses":[{"en":"The burden of the word of the LORD to Israel by Malachi.","n":1,"sm":"le aoaiga ona o raulaga leaga O le avega o le afioga a le ALII ia Isaraelu na aumaia E Malaki.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"aoaiga"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"raulaga"},{"en":"","sm":"leaga"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"avega"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"afioga"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"Isaraelu"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"aumaia"},{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"Malaki."}]},{"en":"I have loved you, saith the LORD. Yet ye say, Wherein hast thou loved us? Was not Esau Jacob's brother? saith the LORD: yet I loved Jacob,","n":2,"sm":"Ua ou alofa atu ia te outou, ua fetalai mai ai le ALII; a ua outou fai mai, Ua e alcfa mai ia i matou i ni a? E le uso ea Esau ma Iakopo? ua fetalai mai ai le ALII; a ua ou alofa ia lakopo,","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"alofa"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"outou,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fetalai"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII;"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"mai,"},{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"alcfa"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"matou"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ni"},{"en":"","sm":"a?"},{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"uso"},{"en":"","sm":"ea"},{"en":"","sm":"Esau"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"Iakopo?"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fetalai"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII;"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"alofa"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm"